.git
# NOTE: .env is intentionally NOT ignored. Vite inlines `import.meta.env.VITE_*`
# at BUILD time, so the build stage needs .env present. The VITE_* vars are
# public (they ship to the browser anyway), and the multi-stage runtime image
# copies only .output — .env never reaches the final image.
node_modules/
dist/
.output/
.nitro/
.tanstack/
storybook-build/
.idea
.vscode
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
dev-dist/
coverage/
